  "priorExpiration": "2009-07-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 521.03 Request for Hearing.\n\n(a) All hearings shall be conducted in accordance with Saf-C 203.\n\n(b) A request for an administrative hearing, pursuant to Saf-C 521.02(d)(4), shall conform with Saf-C 203.03.\n\n(c) Pursuant to RSA 263:56-f, I, a request for a hearing received by the division of motor vehicles more than 30 days from the date the notice pursuant to Saf-C 521.02 is issued, shall be denied as untimely.\n\n(d) Notwithstanding any rule to the contrary, a request for a hearing shall not stay the non-renewal.\n\n(e) The bureau of hearings shall notify the bureau of turnpikes, department of transportation of all hearings scheduled pursuant to this rule.\n\nSource. #8544, eff 1-20-06; ss by #9372, INTERIM, eff 1-26-09, EXPIRES: 7-27-09; ss by #9487, eff 6-23-09; ss by #12426, eff 11-30-17 (formerly Saf-C 217.03) (See Revision Note at part heading for Saf-C 522); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 522.03)",
